          "kind": "line",
          "speaker": "you",
          "expression": null,
          "text": "The card on the console had a name on it, and it was not the one on the door."
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "speaker": "nao",
          "expression": "pleased",
          "text": "Then you were paying attention after all."
