          "kind": "line",
          "speaker": "you",
          "expression": null,
          "text": "Not enough. I went down and I came back."
        },
        {
          "kind": "line",
          "speaker": "haruki",
          "expression": null,
          "text": "That is the answer of a man who wants his supper."
